  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><color=#FBBF24>THE IDEA</color></b>

    Cars are <b>processes</b>,
    bays are <b>resources</b>. A car keeps its bay until the next one is free. If
    the waits close into a loop, nobody can move: a <b>deadlock</b>.


    <b><color=#FBBF24>CONTROLS</color></b>

    <b>Select
    a car, then a bay</b> to send it there (click, tap, or point and pull the trigger).

    <b>ANALYZE</b>
    draws who waits for whom. <b>TOW CAR</b> removes the selected car and breaks
    the loop.

    <b>RESTART</b> replays the demo. <b>GUIDED TOUR</b> explains everything
    in two minutes.


    <b>Desktop</b>  right-drag to orbit, scroll to zoom.

    <b>Headset</b> 
    left stick walk, right stick turn (push up to teleport). Look at a controller
    to see its buttons.

    <b>Hands</b>  point + pinch to select; pinch the ground
    and release to teleport; pinch + flick sideways to turn; left palm up for MENU.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
